<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px;">We couldn't process your payment</h1>
    <p>Hi{{#if recipient_name}} {{recipient_name}}{{/if}},</p>
    <p>Your most recent Growth Project payment of <strong>{{amount_display}}</strong> on <strong>{{attempted_at}}</strong> didn't go through.</p>
    {{#if failure_reason}}
      <p style="background: #fff4f4; border-left: 3px solid #e11d48; padding: 8px 16px; color: #555;">Reason from your bank: {{failure_reason}}</p>
    {{/if}}
    <p>We'll automatically retry over the next few days, but you can fix it faster by updating your card now:</p>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{billing_portal_url}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #e11d48; color: #fff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Update payment method</a>
    </p>
    <p>If you're not sure why the payment failed, your bank will usually have more detail than we do.</p>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">Questions? Just reply to this email.</p>
  </body>
</html>
